ScenarioName = "King Boo Down Below"
metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 264: KING BOO'S FIGHT (the game's casino boss fight, SMS 153 and on) in its OWN LEVEL SCENE -- the Level Select's King Boo poster loads this. Until 264 the arena (KingBooArena.tscn) was a piece of the test level (assets/Level.tscn) floating 37 m over the Plaza, with Mario's spawn moved into its air so the fall-in intro took him; the test level is the Level Select's Test poster now and its spawn is back on the Plaza. Here: the arena at the origin, the chosen character (PlayerSpawner: the Player Select's pick, Mario when none) spawned where he spawned over the arena in the test level (3.8 m off its axis, 12.2 m up: inside the room, in the intro's trigger radius and height band), the test level's sky, tonemap and sun so the room looks as it did there, and a death plane 30 m under the table as a safety net (the game's room has no floor and nothing can leave the table: its outer disc's rim is set 61 units into the wall). No intro pan (the boss's own FallDemo is the intro), no GO text, FLUDD on (the fight is sprayed)."

