metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 264: a safety net under the fight room -- the game's delfinoBoss map.col has no death plane (its wall runs 1500 units under the table and the outer disc's rim is set into the wall, so nothing leaves the table); 30 m under the room's origin, well below the wall's bottom (-20 m), it only catches what the port's own collision lets through. The red Preview sheet shows it in the editor and is hidden in play."

